From 934dd1f2df1690f89eefe11b915267727c1b9a2a Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Sun, 25 Oct 2026 05:57:47 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Add two-way sync with My Day and cloud backup

- Write today's training goals and completion to a shared Supabase table
  (panmatz_daily) and apply completions coming back from My Day via Realtime.
- Offline queue with last-write-wins on updated_at, no duplicates.
- Settings: one-time sign in, sync now, full cloud backup and restore.
- Purely additive: without Supabase keys or sign-in nothing runs and the app
  behaves exactly as before. Local state key is unchanged.
- Tests for the sync logic (npm test).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01VhC1jupvmKnQxdFH5KaLW4
